452 0 obj
<< /DA (/F2 8 Tf 0 g) /F 4 /FT /Tx /Ff 8392704 /P 1047 0 R /Rect [ 22 714 590 741 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (CommercialPolicy_RemarkText_A) /TU (Enter text: The commercial policy general remarks. ) /Type /Annot /V (Account Overview: Orbin Contracting LLC is a Denver, Colorado general contractor doing commercial interior remodeling and tenant finish work for property managers and building owners. Years in Business: the company has operated for 9 years. Ownership: founded in 2017 and owned and run by Michael Orbin. Scope of work: interior remodeling, drywall, framing, finish carpentry and tenant improvements inside commercial buildings; electrical and plumbing are subcontracted to licensed trades; no roofing, no residential and no new ground-up construction. Management: experienced management with over 15 years in commercial construction. Employee / Payroll Context: 6 full-time employees with an annual payroll of $412,000. WC Payroll / Class Code Context: no workers compensation policy is carried today; the six employees' annual payroll of $412,000 falls under carpentry class 5403 and clerical 8810 if WC is quoted. Risk controls: written safety program, weekly toolbox talks, jobsite inspections; subcontractors must carry their own insurance and name us as additional insured. Loss History Discussion: two small claims in the past five years, both closed - a drywall damage claim in 2022 \($3,400\) and a minor auto claim in 2025 \($1,800\); carrier loss runs are attached.) >>
endobj
